# SAIPEN canonical state. The release machinery commits the identity carrier,
# the canonical closure files (STATE/BOARD/LOG/digest/release receipt), the
# source-authority receipts and the release scope records, so those stay
# trackable. Every other .saipen/ path stays machine-local.
.saipen/*
!.saipen/IDENTITY.md
!.saipen/STATE.md
!.saipen/BOARD.md
!.saipen/LOG.md
!.saipen/intake/
!.saipen/archive/
.saipen/archive/*
!.saipen/archive/source/
!.saipen/kitchen/
.saipen/kitchen/*
!.saipen/kitchen/digest.md
!.saipen/kitchen/release_receipt.json
!.saipen/kitchen/release_scope/
!.saipen/logs/
.saipen/logs/*
!.saipen/logs/LOG-*.md
